It builds on the LiveKit Rust SDK (Apache 2.0, https://github.com/livekit/rust-sdks),
which bundles a prebuilt WebRTC (BSD-style licence, https://webrtc.org/support/license),
and on egui/eframe (MIT or Apache 2.0, https://github.com/emilk/egui).
The browser viewer page loads the LiveKit JavaScript SDK (Apache 2.0) from jsDelivr.
